            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="kpi-card amber">
            <div class="kpi-icon"><i class="ri-alarm-warning-line"></i></div>
            <div>
              <div class="kpi-val" id="kpi-downtime-count">0</div>
              <div class="kpi-label">생산 중단 / 비가동 발생 건</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid-2 mb-3">
          <div class="card">
            <div class="card-header"><div class="card-title"><i class="ri-line-chart-line"></i> 공정별 생산량 현황</div></div>
            <div style="height:240px;"><canvas id="chart-prod"></canvas></div>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <div class="card-header"><div class="card-title"><i class="ri-pie-chart-line"></i> 주요 불량 유형 분포</div></div>
            <div style="height:240px;"><canvas id="chart-defect"></canvas></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card mb-3">
          <div class="card-header">
            <div class="card-title"><i class="ri-table-line"></i> 스텔란티스 공정별 실시간 점검 및 클릭 상세 보기</div>
            <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.4rem;">
              <select class="form-select" id="mgr-filter-model" style="width:auto;padding:0.35rem 0.6rem;font-size:0.8rem;">
                <option value="ALL">전체 차종</option>
                <option value="DT CREW">DT CREW</option>
                <option value="DT QUAD">DT QUAD</option>
