        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="modal-backdrop" id="modal-line-alert-popup">
      <div class="modal-container" style="border:3px solid var(--accent-rose);background:#ffffff;color:#0f172a;">
        <div class="modal-header" style="background:#fee2e2;border-bottom:2px solid #fca5a5;">
          <div class="modal-title" style="color:#dc2626;font-size:1.2rem;font-weight:900;">
            <i class="ri-alarm-warning-fill" style="font-size:1.5rem;"></i> 🚨 [긴급 알림] 라인 반복 비가동 발생!
          </div>
          <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline btn-sm" id="btn-close-line-alert-modal" style="color:#991b1b;border-color:#fca5a5;">&times;</button>
        </div>
        <div class="modal-body" style="color:#1e293b;padding:1.5rem;">
          <div style="background:#fef2f2;border:2px dashed #ef4444;border-radius:10px;padding:1.2rem;margin-bottom:1.25rem;">
            <h3 style="font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:900;color:#991b1b;margin-bottom:0.75rem;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.4rem;">
              <i class="ri-error-warning-line"></i> <span id="alert-pop-model">스텔란티스</span> - <span id="alert-pop-part">D/SIDE</span> - <span id="alert-pop-proc">클립머신</span> - <span id="alert-pop-line">1호기</span> 점검 필요!
            </h3>
            <p style="font-size:0.95rem;color:#7f1d1d;line-height:1.6;font-weight:600;">
              해당 라인에서 당일 생산 중단이 <strong><span id="alert-pop-count">2</span>회 이상</strong> 발생하였습니다.<br/>
              설비 이상 또는 결품 여부를 즉시 점검해 주시기 바랍니다.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div style="background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:8px;padding:1rem;">
            <h4 style="font-size:0.88rem;font-weight:800;color:#334155;margin-bottom:0.5rem;">📋 발생 중단 세부 기록 이력</h4>
            <div id="alert-pop-history-list" style="font-size:0.85rem;"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="modal-footer" style="background:#f8fafc;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;">
          <button type="button" class="btn btn-rose btn-block" id="btn-resolve-line-alert" style="padding:0.75rem;font-size:1rem;font-weight:800;">
            <i class="ri-check-line"></i> 조치 완료 (알림 닫기)
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="modal-backdrop" id="modal-mgr-login">
      <div class="modal-container" style="max-width: 350px;">
        <div class="modal-header">
          <div class="modal-title"><i class="ri-lock-password-line"></i> 관리자 로그인</div>
          <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline btn-sm" id="btn-close-mgr-login">&times;</button>
        </div>
        <div class="modal-body">
